    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not just \"struggles\" though. It feels different. It's like there's this core part of me that's just... shattered. I've tried everything, all the therapy, all the coping stuff, and nothing changes. It's like trying to fix a glass that's been ground into dust. You can't just glue dust back together. I don't think I'm \"navigating\" anything anymore, I think I'm just existing in the wreckage.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
